text = "Integrates MRO SHARAD shallow radar (MRO-M-SHARAD-5-RADARGRAM-V1.0) and Odyssey GRS neutron suppression (ODY-M-GRS-5-AND-V1.0). In Martianbound, it governs the -38m Acidalia aquifer borehole extraction directive and 84% pure sub-surface glacier discovery."
